          "kicker": "WXV Global Series",
          "heading": "Italy women dominate Japan with comprehensive 55-21 opening tournament victory",
          "body": "The Italy women's side opened their WXV Global Series campaign in style with a convincing 55-21 win over Japan at Stadio Omero Tognon. After conceding early, the Azzurre responded with a clinical display, including a first-half try fest that saw them pull away to a commanding lead. Captain Vittoria Ostuni Minuzzi celebrated her 50th cap by crossing the whitewash in the second half, helping Italy register their highest-ever points tally against the Sakura XV in a dominant performance."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Japan defeat Fiji 20-15 to claim Pacific Nations Cup",
