          "heading": "Shaun Edwards remains linked to international roles following Red Roses deal",
          "body": "Speculation persists regarding Shaun Edwards’ long-term coaching future following his recent short-term agreement with the Red Roses. While he has now joined the England women's setup, press coverage continues to monitor whether this role will lead to a permanent senior international appointment. As of today, no further details have been confirmed regarding a transition to a men’s Six Nations team, leaving the timeline for his next potential head coaching or defensive consultant move unresolved."
