          "kicker": "Lions Ambition",
          "heading": "Sisilia Tuipulotu eyes Lions selection after dominant Wales women's performance",
          "body": "Wales women's prop Sisilia Tuipulotu has identified a spot on next year's inaugural British and Irish Lions women's tour as her top priority. The Harlequins tight-head produced a world-class, two-try display in Friday's 50-19 WXV Global Series win over South Africa, catching the eye of Lions head coach Jo Yapp. Having credited a rigorous six-week pre-season for her return to form, the 23-year-old is now focused on maintaining that momentum when Wales women face the USA this Saturday."
